                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} f_* : PSh(D) \to PSh(C)
              preserves
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sheaf"} sheaves
              and its
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/left+adjoint"} left adjoint
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
