          %p
            Many simplicial presheaves appearing in practice are (equivalent) to objects in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sub-%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-categories"} sub-(∞,1)-categories
            of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
