                  sAb_{Quillen }
                  \\stackrel{\overset{F}{\leftarrow}}{\underset{U}{\to}}
                  sSet_{Quillen}
          %p
            between the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/model+structure+on+simplicial+abelian+groups"} model structure on simplicial abelian groups
            and the
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/classical+model+structure+on+simplicial+sets"} classical model structure on simplicial sets
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi sAb
                    %mi Quillen
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} sAb_{Quillen}
            as the corresponding
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/transferred+model+structure"} transferred model structure
          %p
            Moreover, the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dold-Kan+correspondence"} Dold-Kan correspondence
            constitutes in particular a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Quillen+equivalence"} Quillen equivalence
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
